title: "Senet: the Modern Kendall rules with 5 pieces, solved"
abstract: >-
  A value-iteration solver for Senet under the Modern Kendall rules with 5 pieces per
  side, the perfect-play engine that reads its database of 8,560,690,670 positions, and a
  small neural network distilled from that database.
